{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a demo version of Megamelon: Suika Beach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo contains the first guest level from the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress made in the demo can be carried over to the full game via your save file.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A familiar fruit merge puzzle game where you drop fruit into a container, but with a naughty twist.\u00a0 Instead of dropping fruit, you drop jiggly boobs wearing fruit themed bikinis!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raising your score will reward you with nudity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588710/extras/megamelon-gameplay.gif?t=1744273100\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Biggle, More Jiggle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The higher your score the bigger and more jiggly the boobs of your guest get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588710/extras/megamelon-boob-expand.gif?t=1744273100\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Powerups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the container gets too &quot;stacked&quot; you can use powerups to stay in the game.\u00a0  <br>Maybe use a bomb to clear some space or a plasma ball to destroy all melons of the same fruit. <br>Maybe use the beach ball and see what happens...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's not cheating.\u00a0 Honest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You get 1 x star for completing the level <br>If you are skilled you can earn additional stars for\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete the level under the limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Merge a <strong>Megamelon</strong> (Watermelon) at least once.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you earn all 3 stars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"